      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَنْدَسَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (the night) <i>was,</i> or <i>became,
dark:</i> (K:) or <i>intensely dark;</i> (TA;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنْدَسَ</span></b> . (Ham p. 140.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He</i> (a man)
<i>fell down;</i> and <i>was weak:</i> (Sgh, K:) mentioned by Sgh in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حدس</span>. (TA.)

